# macOS Metal (passes through mx.metal.is_available) and omarchy-mlx (canary probe).
# The M5 tensor-unit detection in kernels/device.generation() stays Metal-specific by design.
# Target commit: ashhart/TensorFold 609ca419abecebdc5a059498a613680bd3aa847f (== v0.6.5).
